{"id": 16, "ts": 1779512994.1691837, "event": "public_discussion_message", "round": 2, "agent": "agent_1", "message": "I\u2019d like to bring the panel\u2019s attention to Candidate\u202fD. The dossier and my notes highlight strong technical and cognitive abilities: he responds well to unexpected events, concentrates very well, solves problems exceptionally, and takes responsibility seriously. However, we lack any evidence on his stress resilience, decision\u2011making quality, and crew\u2011cooperation\u2014key safety\u2011critical criteria. My interview notes also flag arrogance and relatively weak leadership, which could impact crew dynamics. Given these gaps, I suggest we probe Candidate\u202fD specifically on (1) how he performs under pressure or in crisis situations, (2) his approach to making timely safety\u2011relevant decisions, and (3) his typical interaction style with crew members. This will allow us to compare D more directly with Candidate\u202fC, whose strengths are well\u2011documented but whose communication style and feedback orientation remain concerns.\nMETADATA_JSON:\n{\"agent\": \"agent_1\", \"vote\": \"Candidate C\"}"}
